.$\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $AB=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-2}} |  |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} |  |" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $B$ is the $3$rd *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $3\\times 3$ matrix $A$ by the $3$rd *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3},$ the result must be the $3$rd *column* of $A.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=[\\begin{aligned}-2\\sqrt{6} \\\\ \\sqrt{6} \\\\ -8\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -3 & -2\\sqrt{6} \\\\ -1 & 7 & \\sqrt{6} \\\\ 5 & 0 & -8\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4\\cdot 0+(-3)\\cdot 0+(-2\\sqrt{6})\\cdot 1 \\\\ (-1)\\cdot 0+7\\cdot 0+\\sqrt{6}\\cdot 1 \\\\ 5\\cdot 0+0\\cdot 0+(-8)\\cdot 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2\\sqrt{6} \\\\ \\sqrt{6} \\\\ -8\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186279066 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "89362140-1a17-56fd-a9ab-4da336112bee" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying a Matrix by a Column or Row of the Identity Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "31698fb1-e52c-585c-8467-ec5f309d368a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279068}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "31698fb1-e52c-585c-8467-ec5f309d368a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279068} :answer-field/id #uuid "453b0105-740a-5c86-b2e4-31b0d81a8d60" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279067} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4fef5c82-e84f-51fc-abb8-c6d2c3466578" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{19}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279070}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4fef5c82-e84f-51fc-abb8-c6d2c3466578" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{19}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279070} :answer-field/id #uuid "091cce8e-295f-5415-8b62-acfe23fba23c" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279069} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "22280274-ee36-56c1-b012-0f67f71389ce" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279072}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "22280274-ee36-56c1-b012-0f67f71389ce" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279072} :answer-field/id #uuid "71bbe257-f11b-52ce-9fde-96ddf7e82d83" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279071} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fd52eea5-f1c3-5dce-9968-548fb96f2df0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\ln(3)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279074}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fd52eea5-f1c3-5dce-9968-548fb96f2df0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\ln(3)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279074} :answer-field/id #uuid "2d27b31a-c64a-51fa-bee3-c1738f6ad6aa" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279073}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "58ba1c6a-30ec-5b80-9632-2f7c01b90365" :question/math-academy-id "q-337673" :question/problem "Find the product $EF$, if\n$E=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]$\nand \n$F=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & -8 & \\sqrt{5} & 14 \\\\ -2 & \\frac{7}{5} & -\\frac{\\pi }{2} & 9 \\\\ \\sqrt{17} & -6 & 0 & \\frac{e}{3} \\\\ -11 & \\sqrt{19} & -4 & -\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)\\end{aligned}].$\n\n| $EF=$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $E$ is the $4$th *row* of the identity matrix ${I}_{4}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $4\\times 4$ matrix $F$ by the $4$th *row* of the identity matrix ${I}_{4}$ on the *left*, the result must be the $4$th *row* of $F.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nEF=[\\begin{aligned}-11 & \\sqrt{19} & -4 & -\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}EF & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & -8 & \\sqrt{5} & 14 \\\\ -2 & \\frac{7}{5} & -\\frac{\\pi }{2} & 9 \\\\ \\sqrt{17} & -6 & 0 & \\frac{e}{3} \\\\ -11 & \\sqrt{19} & -4 & -\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-11 & \\sqrt{19} & -4 & -\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186279075 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "89362140-1a17-56fd-a9ab-4da336112bee" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying a Matrix by a Column or Row of the Identity Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5d130fa2-0493-59f0-af50-5160da776d28" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & -\\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279077} {:answer/id #uuid "51168f06-2e01-5b0b-8693-e06b3de9dde2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} \\\\ -3 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279078} {:answer/id #uuid "bbd472d0-73ef-50e9-855a-0399cfed9979" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} & 4 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279079} {:answer/id #uuid "4460027c-0c38-5e6a-8d86-3dc9b9c03c6b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2\\sqrt{2} & -3.2\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279080} {:answer/id #uuid "3d480acf-3659-5c9e-a0aa-59046b467d2b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 2\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279081}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4460027c-0c38-5e6a-8d86-3dc9b9c03c6b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2\\sqrt{2} & -3.2\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279080} :answer-field/id #uuid "d5abea32-c0b7-548b-8c88-75fbbdda6178" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279076}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "c7963c06-fa30-5a29-ac72-ec8ff733ff33" :question/math-academy-id "q-41944" :question/problem "Find the product $AB$, if\n$A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]$\nand \n$B=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} & 4 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 2\\sqrt{2} & -3.2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -\\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $A$ is the $2$nd *row* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $3\\times 3$ matrix $B$ by the $2$nd *row* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}$ on the *left*, the result must be the $2$nd *row* of $B.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2\\sqrt{2} & -3.2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} & 4 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 2\\sqrt{2} & -3.2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -\\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2\\sqrt{2} & -3.2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101315 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "89362140-1a17-56fd-a9ab-4da336112bee" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying a Matrix by a Column or Row of the Identity Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8a95370d-414b-5eac-8919-246de33eac09" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 2\\sqrt{5} & -2.5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099487} {:answer/id #uuid "a84bcb4e-521f-5ea1-9075-3e249dbed932" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3.5 \\\\ -2.5 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099488} {:answer/id #uuid "e006e13f-10ad-5b98-98da-0e4073b443c0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099489} {:answer/id #uuid "2c32ad2d-131b-5f58-b76f-c00ad96820b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{7} \\\\ -2 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099490} {:answer/id #uuid "695edc9d-dd29-5f2a-b8fd-06ab5abd1f2a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{7} & -3 & 3.5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099491}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2c32ad2d-131b-5f58-b76f-c00ad96820b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{7} \\\\ -2 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099490} :answer-field/id #uuid "954dd7be-0875-59ee-8cb2-ab4ad7d267c9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099486}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "bde0cdd0-7dbe-5ba4-9b36-e66cfe099501" :question/math-academy-id "q-41949" :question/problem "Find the product $AB$, if\n$A=[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{7} & -3 & 3.5 \\\\ -2 & 2\\sqrt{5} & -2.5 \\\\ \\sqrt{3} & 4 & 5\\end{aligned}]$\nand \n$B=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $B$ is the $1$st *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $3\\times 3$ matrix $A$ by the $1$st *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3},$ the result must be the $1$st *column* of $A.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{7} \\\\ -2 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{7} & -3 & 3.5 \\\\ -2 & 2\\sqrt{5} & -2.5 \\\\ \\sqrt{3} & 4 & 5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{7}\\cdot 1+(-3)\\cdot 0+3.5\\cdot 0 \\\\ (-2)\\cdot 1+2\\sqrt{5}\\cdot 0+(-2.5)\\cdot 0 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\cdot 1+4\\cdot 0+5\\cdot 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{7} \\\\ -2 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186279082 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1f2f5234-df9c-5269-8702-30b4dde9a2ca" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying a Matrix by the Identity Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6318e6c4-3038-58fb-859d-55b35398554e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279084} {:answer/id #uuid "02cba70d-12d1-5f0f-88bd-12b00b1745f4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 5\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279085} {:answer/id #uuid "16a3d52c-5951-5963-9165-8996f68ee537" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & -5 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279086} {:answer/id #uuid "d99fc1d1-7e3c-5f87-9e9b-74f23f943c4a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279087} {:answer/id #uuid "dd8716e3-b0ef-5eb3-b23f-2bb6925edc74" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279088}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dd8716e3-b0ef-5eb3-b23f-2bb6925edc74" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279088} :answer-field/id #uuid "2b67b9cc-b923-54d5-b2be-4a5443946aa3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592